{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","externalID":"s:10TUIkitView11RenderPhaseO","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderPhase"}],"title":"RenderPhase","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderPhase"}]},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/measure","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/render"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/SQ","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/SH","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/s8SendableP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"The evaluation phase of the current render pass.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RenderPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A single frame may traverse the view tree several times before anything"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches the terminal:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layout measurement"}]},{"text":" — containers call ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sizeThatFits"},{"text":" (or render to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"measure) arbitrarily often to negotiate sizes, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderLoop"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"performs a full sizing pass on the first frame to discover the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"header height. None of these traversals produce the frame’s output.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Candidate-tree evaluation","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — the pass whose buffer becomes (or may","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"become) the frame’s terminal output. A frame can evaluate more than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one candidate: when the header height turns out different from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"estimate, a correction pass re-evaluates the tree and the earlier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"candidate is discarded.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderPhase"},{"type":"text","text":" makes this distinction explicit on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderContext\/phase","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so that effect sites can tell sizing work apart from output work."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Invariants","level":2,"anchor":"Invariants"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/measure","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"no effect may reach live runtime state","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no lifecycle"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or task mounting, no focus or handler registration, no state, cache,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"preference, header, status-bar, or terminal mutation. Bodies must be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evaluable arbitrarily often without observable consequences."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/render"},{"type":"text","text":", effects belong to a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"candidate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" tree. They must not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applied to live runtime state during traversal either, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"candidate may still be discarded by a correction pass. Instead they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recorded and applied exactly once when the frame commits (see the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"classification rule below)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Committing is "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" a phase of this enum: no view body is ever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evaluated while the frame commits. The commit is an explicit step in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderLoop.render()"},{"type":"text","text":" after the final candidate is known."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Classifying an effect","level":2,"anchor":"Classifying-an-effect"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When writing or reviewing an effect site, ask one question:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"“Does the effect outlive the frame?”","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (key handlers, preference values, status-bar items, header"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer, focus registrations): write it into the current pass’s scratch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collector. The final pass’s collector replaces the live state wholesale;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"discarded passes are simply dropped."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":"onAppear","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"onDisappear","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" actions, ","type":"text"},{"code":".task","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" mounts, ","type":"text"},{"code":"onChange","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"code":"onPreferenceChange","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" actions, GC liveness): record it. The frame","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"commit diffs the final records against persistent runtime state and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applies the difference exactly once.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This mirrors SwiftUI’s model, where per-update values are recomputed and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replaced with each committed tree, while lifetime effects derive from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identity diff between committed trees."}]},{"style":"note","name":"See Also","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderContext\/phase"},{"type":"text","text":", and the frame choreography comment on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderLoop"},{"type":"text","text":" for where each phase begins and ends."}]}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RenderPhase":{"title":"RenderPhase","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RenderPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The evaluation phase of the current render pass."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RenderPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RenderPhase/measure":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/measure","title":"RenderPhase.measure","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Layout sizing. Bodies may be evaluated arbitrarily often; no effect"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"may reach live runtime state."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase\/measure","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"measure","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RenderPhase/Equatable-Implementations":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase\/equatable-implementations","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/Equatable-Implementations","title":"Equatable Implementations"},"doc://TUIkit/SQ":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Equatable","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/SQ"},"tuikit-logo.png":{"type":"image","alt":"TUIkit Logo","identifier":"tuikit-logo.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/TUIkit\/tuikit-logo.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit":{"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"tuikit-logo.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"tuikit-logo.png"}],"role":"collection","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A declarative, SwiftUI-like framework for building Terminal User Interfaces in Swift.","type":"text"}],"title":"TUIkit","kind":"symbol"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RenderPhase/render":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Candidate-tree evaluation for the frame’s output. Effects are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recorded for the frame commit, never applied directly."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/render","title":"RenderPhase.render","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase\/render","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"render"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://TUIkit/SH":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Hashable","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/SH"},"doc://TUIkit/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RenderContext/phase":{"title":"phase","abstract":[{"text":"The evaluation phase of the current render pass.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderContext\/phase","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/rendercontext\/phase","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"phase"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10TUIkitView11RenderPhaseO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RenderPhase"}],"role":"symbol"}}}